==V6==
[[File:R. E. Olds Transportation Museum July 2018 54 (c. 1983 Oldsmobile V6 experimental diesel engine).jpg|thumb|1983 V6 experimental at the [[RE Olds Transportation Museum]]]]

In 1982, GM introduced a 4.3-liter V6 for [[Longitudinal engine|longitudinal]] and [[Transverse engine|transverse]] applications. All versions of the engine were rated at {{convert|85|bhp|kW|0|abbr=on}} at 3600&nbsp;rpm and {{convert|165|lbft|Nm|0|abbr=on}} at 1600&nbsp;rpm.  It did not have the same problems as the V8, as it has a denser bolt pattern and Oldsmobile's engineers were given more time to develop and test it.<ref name=popmech/>

